{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_850.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"8b1893400849b5fc1f9ced59ef5fc23b0225a74c4328cec2c4aef76e0c3344fc","ja":"ダンシング・ステージ","zh":"舞动舞台","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_850.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ee6b230a28b1d471bc60ee51e83450e00a39b3216157beca22f7a55b52ffcb5d","ja":"ダンス勝負、中途半端でモヤモヤしちゃうよ～！\nテンションあがりたりないっ！！","zh":"舞蹈对决半途而废，真让人憋得慌啊～！\n还没嗨够呢！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_850.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"fa6eecc508f833c03f219ac5141a2c66e8543d9cbf0e108a42554180a4dcae34","ja":"ワタシもモヤモヤだヨ～。……ン？　ウミ、\nステージの方からすごい歓声が聞こえるヨ……！","zh":"我也觉得心里闷闷的呀～……嗯？海美，舞台那边传来了好大的欢呼声……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_850.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"1e59bf4307a0a545bedb644043f1f7e99ea68c1b2103f3604145d8afd5168a57","ja":"ワアアアアッ！！","zh":"哇啊啊啊啊！！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_850.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"7ae15bfbe005ee8b5db66239e0f78856e5016122798d6d4ec1dc00e7426f4359","ja":"ははっ！　気合い入れ直すために、\nステージ借りて踊ってただけなのに……！","zh":"哈哈！我只是为了重新振作精神，借了舞台跳舞而已……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_850.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"e800fb85173ddf0868b8db86b45f529d3b6615e5c106ae61fa1a3f927ebd0a77","ja":"野生の動物が集まってきちゃうなんて！　リスも\n鹿も……ヘビも！　なんでも来いだ！　踊ろうよ！","zh":"野生动物居然都聚过来了！松鼠、鹿……还有蛇！不管什么都尽管来吧！一起跳舞吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_850.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"56db8d5826110e676345742c1a4415ea2177a2184eba83964e668c483080ccde","ja":"隣のプロレス団体の人も、来てくれたよ！\nコールもしてくれるなんて……感激！","zh":"隔壁职业摔跤团体的人也过来了！\n没想到还会帮忙带动现场应援……太感动了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_850.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"81d512640a400ce9c6270790ab2f38a249b17282539be105dcf1e7cfc4a143f0","ja":"アタシも緊張なんてしてる場合じゃないよね！\nみんなー、ついてきて！","zh":"我也没时间紧张了！  \n大家——跟上我！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_850.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"6d562bd1422d580e1fdea929991252bb053d09914969f6cc47decc25e2ab64d0","ja":"アユムとノリコのダンスに、動物とプロレスラーが\n集まってきてる……！　すごいヨー♪","zh":"步和典子的舞蹈吸引了动物和职业摔跤手聚集过来……！好厉害哟♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_850.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"b4377e3d8fe6a44c88cb8a67a16dce7c7ae9d724b173c185727d9785899d6ca9","ja":"うわあ、最高だねっ！　勝負とか関係なく\nノリノリになっちゃうよ♪","zh":"哇，太棒了！不管是不是比赛，都会让人兴奋起来♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_850.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"fa0a7486d036cd343bb70ec4fac1e30ae987cccdb7711bb5700f71d7ace0bdf9","ja":"わかるヨ～♪　ふたりともいいナ～！\nあんな楽しそうなダンス見せられたら……！","zh":"我懂～♪ 两个人都好棒～！\n要是看到那么开心的舞蹈……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_850.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"0277ed6a47b34524b682fa51809c7510a7260477a26543f2715df46a95ebafe4","ja":"うう～っ！　もう我慢できない！\nえれなん、私たちも飛び込んじゃお！！","zh":"呜呜～！已经忍不住了！\n艾莲娜，我们也跳进去吧！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_850.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"a129d3d1d2f69c96f75ba9c9e01076b1ecb9488807b04484248c536e1b622bc7","ja":"ウン♪　みんなで盛り上げて\nこのまま本番に突入だヨ～！！","zh":"嗯♪　大家一起把气氛炒热起来，就这样直接进入正式演出吧～！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
